{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やー ♪   ろってぃ-だお〜."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も朝から とある大事な撮影です."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早朝にバスの中から景色を\nとってみました."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/10/17/8697972/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく綺麗...\nこんな景色、毎日見たい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ 逆さにになってるね´ω`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こ-ゆう景色 ろってぃ-大好きや."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てる服は まだひみちゅっ !!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗に手で隠せました. あはん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/10/17/8697972/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、そーいえば昨日のお風呂は\nまひろ.さゆにゃん.らりん.ちはる.ねね.\nゆうりで温泉に入りました(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆で露天風呂で 肩もみをしたり\n温かくて癒されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はなかなか大変な１日に なりそ〜なのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも 元気もりもりでろってぃ-ちゃん\n頑張る〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆も 頑張ってくださいねん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし"}],"source":"archive"}